    "## ✅ Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "You learned about:\n",
    "1. **Output eval** - Check final answer correctness\n",
    "2. **Trajectory eval** - Check path/tools used\n",
    "3. **RAG eval** - Check knowledge retrieval\n",
    "4. **Safety eval** - Check for issues\n",
    "\n",
